      "writtenOn": "2021-04-26T22:59:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t know enough about the chip to fully review this, you\u0027re probably more on an expert than me.\n\nAs far as the EC functionality, it\u0027s ok.\n\nStylistically the commit could use more work, it\u0027s very hard to tell what it attempts to do.",
      "revId": "789389c3230653ce59159a46edb72e515de36a31",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
